// FIN WITH THE DOT . INDICATES FINISHED CHAIN OF COMMAND FROM STERT TO FIN. THE LACK THERE OF ANY TRACE OF ERMAGERD IS THE CHEEKY GOODBYE PRONENOUNCED CORRECTLY AND DISTICNTLY. The 'f' typed as lowercase should automatically be corrected to a ƒ florin lowercase f during lexing / syntax highlighting.
